          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Only for wet pickup, where the pleated cartridge must come out anyway. For any dry debris the filter is essential \u2014 without it, fine dust passes through the impeller into the motor windings and is blown back into the room through the exhaust. The machine appears to work fine, which is exactly why the habit is common."
          }
